[I] A client for the network information system (NIS)

[T] Ypbind is the client for the network information system (NIS).

[U] https://www.kernel.org/

[A] Swen <swen@uni-paderborn.de>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 3.3

[D] 392cd6fe8f4187f109efda917ba911262a7ec579c54e7f1c44eee20a ypbind-3.3.tar.bz2 https://dl.t2sde.org/mirror/8.0/y/

# no DESTDIR
var_append makeinstopt ' ' 'sbindir=$root$sbindir mandir=$root$mandir'
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "$(pkg-config --cflags --libs libtirpc)"
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -std=gnu17
